# Google Sheets waitlist webhook (required for Exclusive Priority Launch form)
#
# Setup (recommended — works even if Extensions → Apps Script fails):
# 1. Create a sheet at https://sheets.google.com
# 2. Copy Sheet ID from URL: .../spreadsheets/d/SHEET_ID/edit
# 3. Open https://script.google.com → New project
# 4. Paste frontend/scripts/google_sheets_webhook.gs and set SPREADSHEET_ID inside it
# 5. Run testSetup once, then Deploy → Web app (Me / Anyone)
# 6. Paste the web app URL below and restart `npm start`
REACT_APP_GOOGLE_SHEETS_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Optional: only needed if you use the AI chat assistant with a hosted backend
# REACT_APP_BACKEND_URL=
